    "d400": {
      "line": {
        "literal": "Hey, hey! So you got caught in that rift in the sky too, huh? I was in Tempest running errands for Lord Rimuru when it tore open and yanked me straight through it. You too, huh? I figured, with gear like that, you've gotta be an adventurer, right?"
      },
      "actions": [],
      "type": "choice",
      "choices": [
        {
          "literal": "Yeah, caught in the rift.",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": [],
          "goto_node": "d404"
        },
        {
          "literal": "Not yet.",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "d404": {
      "line": {
        "literal": "Perfect timing! I'm one of the first faces you'll meet here, so listen up! Every adventurer gets a Core Satchel — Monster Cores are packed with magicules, and no ordinary pack can hold 'em safely. I can send yours to your Dungeon Mailbox whenever you're ready!"
      },
      "actions": [],
      "type": "choice",
      "choices": [
        {
          "literal": "What are Monster Cores?",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": [],
          "goto_node": "d401"
        },
        {
          "literal": "What's the Core Satchel?",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": [],
          "goto_node": "d402"
        },
        {
          "literal": "I understand. Send it to my mailbox.",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": "run_command",
              "target": "player",
              "command": "tensuradungeon satchel acknowledge {player}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "literal": "Not yet.",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "d401": {
      "line": {
        "literal": "Monster Cores are like magicule batteries you pull off dungeon monsters — packed with stored magicules, real useful stuff! But they're way too wild for a regular backpack."
      },
      "actions": [],
      "type": "choice",
      "choices": [
        {
          "literal": "Too wild for a backpack.",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": [],
          "goto_node": "d405"
        },
        {
          "literal": "What's the Core Satchel?",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": [],
          "goto_node": "d402"
        },
        {
          "literal": "Send it to my mailbox.",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": "run_command",
              "target": "player",
              "command": "tensuradungeon satchel acknowledge {player}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "literal": "Not yet.",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "d402": {
      "line": {
        "literal": "The Core Satchel's the best pouch a Monster Core could ask for! Keeps 'em secure, keeps 'em organized, and you can open it any time from the left side of your inventory. Easy peasy!"
      },
      "actions": [],
      "type": "choice",
      "choices": [
        {
          "literal": "How do I claim it?",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": [],
          "goto_node": "d403"
        },
        {
          "literal": "Send it to my mailbox.",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": "run_command",
              "target": "player",
              "command": "tensuradungeon satchel acknowledge {player}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "literal": "Maybe later.",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "d405": {
      "line": {
        "literal": "That's why the Dungeon Shop hands every adventurer a Core Satchel. Every core you recover goes right in there, safe and snug. I'd trust that pouch with my life! ...Well, my loot, anyway."
      },
      "actions": [],
      "type": "choice",
      "choices": [
        {
          "literal": "Safe and snug, huh?",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": [],
          "goto_node": "d402"
        },
        {
          "literal": "Send it to my mailbox.",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": "run_command",
              "target": "player",
              "command": "tensuradungeon satchel acknowledge {player}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "literal": "Not yet.",
