    "d403": {
      "line": {
        "literal": "Simple as can be! Tell me to send it, and boom — a Dungeon Shop Welcome Package lands in your Dungeon Mailbox. Open it and the Normal Core Satchel unlocks for keeps — six whole slots! Claim it whenever you're ready, boss!"
